  Update Model Permissions


› 1. Read Only (current)  Read workspace files, with approval required for edits
                          or internet access
  2. Ask for approval     Read and edit workspace files and run commands, with
                          approval required for internet access or edits outside
                          the workspace
  3. Ask                  Codex has full access to edit files and access the
                          internet. Commands the policy flags as dangerous
                          require approval; other commands run directly without
                          a sandbox. (For per-command approval use Granular
                          policies.)
  4. Full Access          Use with caution: Codex can edit files outside this
                          workspace and access the internet without approval

